ice  players back I doubt that many people  decided to pick up Diablo 3 again to  play the extra story bits particularly  when Blizzard improves on the gameplay  so drastically for gamers who loved the  grind and loot chase  that's a very similar reason to why  destiny players continue to return to  the universe every day Oh  3.2 million of you as much as everybody  mutually agrees that Destiny's story  isn't anything to write home about  destiny has been sold and promoted  primarily as an always online  multiplayer FPS where the title concerns  our loot and shooting noobs in the face  to get that loot and most gamers seem to  be happy to take it for what it is which  suggests the perhaps Destiny's lack of  engaging story doesn't matter all that  much the overall experience at least not  to those of you who've enjoyed it but  let me know what you think gherkin  destiny is allowed to have a weak story  or should games like this work hard to  be good in every aspect leave me your  thoughts and I will catch you next week
 

